ary":"The New York Times reports the two militaries have drawn up plans for a short, intensive campaign after the Nov. 3 U.S. midterms. No final decision has been made, and the White House says all options are on the table.","source":"Times of Israel","url":"https://www.timesofisrael.com/us-israel-said-to-draft-plans-for-resumed-strikes-on-iran-after-midterm-elections/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n3"},{"cat":"World","title":"Europe on edge as Trump moves closer to Putin on Ukraine","summary":"Trump agreed a diesel deal with Moscow, invited Putin to the December G20 and urged Ukraine to hold new elections. European officials voiced alarm, and Norway and Finland arranged new peace talks in Oslo.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/its-terrifying-ukraine-and-europe-on-edge-as-trump-sides-with-putin","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n4"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa gives Stelco 15 days to reverse Hamilton layoffs","summary":"Industry Minister Melanie Joly says owner Cleveland-Cliffs broke a 2024 deal by laying off up to 500 Hamilton workers and threatens legal action. The company denies a breach and blames the 50% U.S. steel tariff.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12113124/stelco-layoff-lawsuit-melanie-joly/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n5"},{"cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI reportedly seeks $30B at a $1.25 trillion valuation","summary":"OpenAI is negotiating a raise of up to $30 billion led by Coatue and UAE investors at a $1.25 trillion pre-money valuation, below a reported $1.4 trillion target, ahead of a planned IPO.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/openai-working-on-new-30b-raise-at-1-25t-valuation-ahead-of-ipo/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Brent oil tops $114 as European shares slip","summary":"Brent rose to $114.73 a barrel Friday after a 4% jump, with WTI above $100. The Stoxx 600 fell 0.4% and Kering slid over 11% on weak Gucci sales.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/oil-prices-climb-above-113-as-ai-sell-off-rattles-stocks-and-investors-buy-bonds","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n7"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Timing of CFB Wainwright live-fire drill under scrutiny","summary":"Four soldiers died and 13 remain in critical condition after the Oct. 17 training-range fire in Alberta. Base orders advised early-morning shoots in fire season, but the exercise ran later in the day; three probes are underway.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12113035/officials-to-provide-update-on-fatal-fire-at-cfb-wainwright-in-alberta/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n8"},{"cat":"AI","title":"DeepSeek reportedly raises about $15 billion","summary":"Chinese AI lab DeepSeek raised roughly $15 billion, with Tencent and CATL among potential backers, days after the U.S. ordered federal agencies to remove its technology.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/deepseek-reportedly-raises-15b-days-after-us-restrictions/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n9"},{"cat":"World","title":"Typhoon Champi kills one, cancels 931 flights in Taiwan","summary":"Champi left one dead and 94 injured in Taiwan, closed schools and offices, and forced the evacuation of nearly 1,300 people from mountain areas.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/23/taiwan-deadly-typhoon-champi-brings-travel-chaos-and-school-closures","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canadian diplomats told to avoid U.S. midterm candidates","summary":"A Global Affairs memo directs diplomats in the U.S. not to meet or appear with midterm candidates, after the U.S. embassy accused Canadian politicians of trying to influence American politics.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12114128/canada-diplomats-not-to-meet-with-midterm-candidates/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Moderna sinks nearly 20% after melanoma vaccine data leak","summary":"Phase 3 results for the Moderna-Merck mRNA melanoma vaccine, showing a 42% cut in recurrence or death risk, appeared online early. Moderna shares fell nearly 20%, leading S&P 500 decliners.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/moderna-stock-sinks-nearly-20-205054593.html","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n12"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Microsoft AI diagnoses 83% of hard cases vs. 36% for doctors","summary":"A Science study found Microsoft's MAI-DxO solved 83% of complex NEJM cases, versus 36% for generalist doctors working alone. Specialists were not included in the comparison.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/22/microsofts-mustafa-suleyman-says-its-ai-outperforms-doctors-on-hard-cases-as-he-chases-medical-superintelligence/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n13"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Barclays to cut 5,000 jobs, citing AI efficiency","summary":"Barclays will cut about 5% of its workforce by the end of 2026 to save over \u00a31.1 billion. Q3 attributable profit rose to \u00a31.65 billion and it announced a \u00a3500 million buyback.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/barclays-to-cut-5000-jobs-as-it-turns-to-ai-to-improve-efficiency","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Supreme Court to hear Ottawa's Emergencies Act appeal","summary":"Canada's top court will hear the federal appeal of rulings that the 2022 use of the Emergencies Act against the convoy protests was unjustified, along with cross-appeals from civil liberties groups.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12113125/supreme-court-emergencies-act/","published":"2026-10-22","id":"n15"},{"cat":"World","title":"First Russian diesel cargo heads to U.S. under new deal","summary":"A tanker carrying nearly 300,000 barrels of Russian diesel left Primorsk and is due on the U.S. East Coast around Nov. 7, which would be the first such U.S. import since the 2022 ban.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/first-russian-diesel-shipment-is-heading-to-us-under-trump-putin-deal","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n16"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Alien and Top Gun actor Tom Skerritt dies at 93","summary":"Skerritt died of natural causes, his family said. He won an Emmy for Picket Fences and also starred in Steel Magnolias and Contact.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/tributes-paid-to-actor-tom-skerritt-as-star-of-alien-and-top-gun-dies-aged-93","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n17"}]}